<body><div class="wrap">
<div class="top"><div><div class="brand">NASA • DEEP SPACE OPERATIONS</div><div class="small muted">MISSION DIRECTOR SIMULATOR / 2030</div></div><div class="tag">MISSION DIRECTOR: <span id="directorNameTag">PROFILE NOT SELECTED</span></div></div>

<section id="intro" class="screen active">
<div class="panel hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">CHAPTER 01 · THE CALL FROM NASA</div><h1>MISSION<br><span style="color:var(--cyan)">DIRECTOR</span></h1><p>The year is 2030. Before astronauts can safely return to the Moon and eventually travel to Mars, NASA needs high-resolution maps of hidden water ice and safe landing zones.</p><p>NASA has called you to Mission Control. You are the new <b>Lead Mission Director</b>. Your job is to build a robotic scout spacecraft, send it into orbit, collect science data and get that data safely back to Earth.</p><div class="brief"><b>MISSION BRIEFING</b><br>“Director, Congress has approved a strict <b>$175 million</b> budget. Choose your rocket and equipment carefully. Your spacecraft must stay within its weight limit, survive deep space and transmit enough science before time runs out. Space doesn't give second chances.”</div><div class="profile-picker">
<div class="eyebrow">CHOOSE YOUR ASTRONAUT PROFILE</div>
